@L_mes
\c[51]Muddy\c[0] says "Go farther."
\c[51]I\c[0] thinks so too. <plusA>

entries.translation:
@voice VC_COCO_028.at9
@L_mes
\c[50]<PLAYER>\c[0]前进到了\c[53]<VAL>\c[0]km！
