\c[51]我\c[0]也会精神地走很远！

entries.previous_translation:
@voice VC_COCO_029.at9
@L_mes
珃瓳 \c[50]<PLAYER>\c[0] 完全进步 \c[53]<VAL>\c[0] 数公里!
