@L_mes
\c[51]ココ\c[0]も元気にいっぱい歩くね！

entries.source:
@voice VC_COCO_030.at9
@L_mes
Wow, \c[50]<PLAYER>\c[0] totally progressed \c[53]<VAL>\c[0] km!
